AD doesn't manage only users.

It also knows about computers.

For example:

Active Directory
      |
      +-- Computers
           |
           +-- CLIENT01
           +-- CLIENT02
           +-- CLIENT03

When you join CLIENT01 to the domain:

CLIENT01
    |
    | Join domain
    ↓
lab.local
    |
    ↓
SERVER01
    |
    ↓
Computer account created

Now the Domain Controller knows:

"CLIENT01 is one of the computers in my domain."
